// OddsService groups the Odds endpoints. Odds are kept apart from match data. Fixtures, lists and stream deltas contain no betting fields, so nothing odds-related reaches your users unless you call the endpoints in this group or subscribe to the odds:{id} channel, the only two places where prices exist. The prices are those of a single bookmaker, before kick-off and in play, and reach us through our data source with no bookmaker named; they have been available since 2026-11-04. The endpoints are part of the Pro, Business and Enterprise plans, the live channel of Business and Enterprise. Before you show them, check the rules on displaying betting odds that apply where your users are, because they differ from place to place. The prices themselves come from a third party and are information only: not an offer to bet, and not betting advice. Adults only (18+); gamble responsibly.
